<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκίφος</span></b>  (q. v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sword,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. μέγα, ὀξύ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.530
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				863
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.2.9
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. ἄμφηκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.118
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.80
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. ἀργυρόηλον χάλκεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.372
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. σὺν κολεῷ . . καὶ ἐϋτμήτῳ
					τελαμῶνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.303
				</span></i>
			 : used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> as equivalent of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄορ</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσγανον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.48
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				10.294
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				321
			</span></i>) ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχαιρα.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>power of life and death,</i> Lat. <i>jus gladii,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sword-shaped bone</i> in the cuttle-fish (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τευθίς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				524b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				654a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.558
			</span></i> ; also in the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφίας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				325
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξιφίον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.13.1
			</span></i>.</div>
